rule row_the_table_above_leaves_out v1
description "A row for a medium band at any amount, after the rows below 70 yen: the band is medium only below 29 yen, which the second row takes first, so no input reaches the third"

enum choice = one | two
enum size = small | medium | large

inputs
  amount : money[JPY]  range >=1JPY <=79JPY

outputs
  x : choice

table band_of
| amount         | -> band : size |
| <29JPY         | medium         |
| >=29JPY <=52JPY | small         |
| >=53JPY        | large          |

table pick
policy first
| amount  | band   | -> x |
| <70JPY  | small  | one  |
| <70JPY  | medium | two  |
| -       | medium | one  |
| >=70JPY | large  | two  |
| <70JPY  | large  | one  |
